          "url": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "title": "Url"
          },
          "fetched_at": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time",
            "title": "Fetched At"
          },
          "fact": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Fact"
          },
          "field": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Field"
          },
          "value": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Value"
          }
        },
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "source",
          "url",
          "fetched_at",
          "fact"
        ],
        "title": "Evidence",
        "description": "One fact and where it came from. A fact without Evidence is not shown (CLAUDE.md).\n\n`url` is required: organizers' data uses `data:<table>#<row key>`, the web uses http(s).\nThe DATA loader MUST add `Evidence(field=\"inn\", value=<inn>, url=\"data:…\")` for every\ncounterparty from organizers' data: without it strip_unverified() shows \"ИНН не подтверждён\".\n`field`/`value` name the extracted value (inn, phone, email, address, ...); for web\nsources `value` must literally occur in the cached page text (src/enrich/evidence.py)."
      },
